This repository implements these methodological foundations for AMLSim bank
partitions while adapting the implementation and protocol boundaries, including
recipient-routed aggregate rows and separate transport, payload-protection, and
model-update privacy layers. No FedGCN or FedGraph repository is vendored, and
neither project is a runtime dependency. The links above document the principal
method and implementation reference points for client graph construction,
federated aggregation, and pretraining feature aggregation.

